  "name": "E-Invoice Validation Pipeline",
  "outcome": "Gated four-step e-invoice validation pipeline: format conformance check (Factur-X, XRechnung, PINT-AE, MyInvois, Peppol BIS 3.0/Belgium, KSeF FA(3)/Poland), VAT arithmetic verification, jurisdiction mandate routing, and a hash-anchored transmission receipt carrying the SPEC.md §27 pre-transmission release gate (review_required, schema-only pending HA-RETRO-1). Exits early on a format-conformance failure or a VAT-arithmetic mismatch, so the receipt is only ever built for a document that passed both checks.",
